n gunplay players are able to  utilize class-based abilities  and synchronize them along with your  teammates while still building towards a  unique style of play  outriders is looking like a game that  will contain a vast and satisfying  narrative  i'm actually looking quite forward to  trying this out and fingers crossed  being that it's a 2021 release the  difficulties that have plagued the  releases of more recent games hopefully  won't be showing face anytime soon  i hope you've enjoyed this video and  i'll catch you in the next one cheers  you

